flowchart LR
    C[Clients] --> CDN[CDN and static event page]
    C --> GW[API gateway<br/>rate limit per user and IP,<br/>bot checks]
    GW --> Q[Waiting room service<br/>issues signed queue tokens,<br/>admits at a fixed rate]
    Q --> QS[(Redis<br/>queue position, admitted set,<br/>admission counter)]
    GW --> BK[Booking service<br/>admits only valid tokens,<br/>hold, pay, confirm]
    BK --> INV[(Seat inventory DB<br/>relational, one shard per event)]
    BK --> BDB[(Orders DB<br/>state machine, idempotency, outbox)]
    BK --> PAY[Payment service]
    BDB -->|outbox relay| K[Kafka]
    K --> N[Tickets, email, analytics, anti-fraud]
    SW[Hold expiry sweeper] --> BK
    SM[Seat map read service] --> SMC[(Seat map cache<br/>availability snapshot,<br/>refreshed every second)]
    INV -->|CDC| K
    K --> SMC
